# Cursor - Torii Project

Inherits all rules from `../docs/_shared.md`. Read that file first.

## Cursor-Specific Config

- Use .cursorrules for AI behavior rules
- MCP servers configured in `.cursor/mcp.json`
- Settings in `.cursor/settings.json`

## Tool-Specific Notes

- Cursor reads .cursorrules automatically
- Use @file to reference files in prompts
- Prefer asking before making large changes
